WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.060
«And who sees my contacts?»

2
00:00:02.110 --> 00:00:03.580
It's a fair worry.

3
00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:06.290
No other networker sees your contacts.

4
00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.770
RelAI doesn't write to anyone:

5
00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:10.890
the messages leave from your phone,

6
00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:15.550
with your name. And RelAI doesn't offer anything to your contacts.

7
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.590
The contacts are yours.

8
00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.610
And they stay yours.
